proxy:          (no block, so no proxy at all)
who resolves:   (nothing — the block has no default for it)
reached direct: (nothing — with no proxy there is nothing to go around)
point it at me: no
let it resolve: no
HTTPS_PROXY:    (unset here, and it would change nothing either way)
writable by me: url -> no
